      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, if we just use a lottery, wouldn't that be pretty inefficient? Like, if someone making way more money than the cutoff wins a unit over a family literally living in a car, doesn't that defeat the whole purpose of \"affordable\" housing? It feels like a lottery ignores the actual crisis people are facing.",
